message: "If you use this code or site, please cite it as below, and cite the data sources listed in the README and under references."
title: "Molecular Tissue Fingerprints: a 20-gene panel, its conformal guarantee, and what a within-study fingerprint can identify"
type: software
version: "1.4.0"
date-released: 2026-09-26
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/CoryGardner/motrpac_challenge"
url: "https://corygardner.github.io/motrpac_challenge/"
